# Afenda UI composition (agents + IDE)

Canonical doc: `packages/ui/COMPOSITION.md`. Token doc: `packages/ui/shadcn-update.md`.

Upstream shadcn skill: `.agents/skills/shadcn/SKILL.md` — **Afenda ERP rules below take precedence** in scoped paths.

## Pick shell before primitives

1. **Module section** → `SectionPanel` from `@afenda/ui` (title, description, eyebrow, aside).
2. **Governed list/stat** → `GovernedPatternCListSection` / stat groups from `@afenda/governed-surface`.
3. **Form** → `FieldGroup` + `Field` + `FieldLabel` (never `div` + `space-y-*` / bare `grid` form layout).
4. **Empty / callout** → `Empty` or `Alert` — not custom dashed-border divs.
5. **Card** → only for **single tiles** (indicator, bullet column item, dialog inner panel) — **never** as the outer section wrapper.

## Banned patterns in product code

| Do not generate | Use instead |
| --------------- | ----------- |
| `<Card><CardHeader>…<CardContent><Card>…` (nested cards) | `SectionPanel` + `BulletColumns` or one card per tile |
| Multiple top-level `<Card>` siblings for a section | One `SectionPanel` |
| `div` with `rounded-section border p-surface-*` as section chrome | `SectionPanel` or `surface-panel` utility |
| `SectionPanelLite` / local card clones | `SubsectionPanel` from `@afenda/ui` |
| Raw `<button>` | `Button` from `@afenda/ui` |
| `space-y-*` / `space-x-*` | `flex flex-col gap-*` / `flex flex-row gap-*` |
| Hand-built ERP tables in features | Governed list section + metadata |

## Component quick pick

| Need | Component |
| ---- | --------- |
| Section header + body | `SectionPanel` |
| 2-column bullet explainer | `BulletColumns` |
| KPI row | `ObservabilityIndicatorList` or governed stats |
| 2–5 toggled options | `ToggleGroup` |
| Form tile in grid (3-up pathway forms) | `SubsectionPanel` |
| Modal task | `Dialog` + `DialogTitle` + `DialogDescription` |
| Destructive confirm | `AlertDialog` |
| Side panel | `Sheet` |
| Code block | `surface-code` + `type-code` |

